id: 26
hanzi: 似的
pinyin: shì de
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Particle

meanings_summary:
  en: like; as; as if; resembling (auxiliary particle used in comparisons)
  es: como; tal como; como si (partícula auxiliar de semejanza tras sustantivos o verbos)

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Particle | Standard | auxiliary particle used at the end of a phrase (often with 像 or 仿佛) to indicate similarity or resemblance | partícula auxiliar que indica semejanza o apariencia ("como...", "como si...") | 像飞似的 (as if flying)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 听完除夕的传说，孩子们高兴得像过节似的一蹦一跳，迫不及待地盼着穿新衣。 | Tīng wán Chúxī de chuánshuō, háizimen gāoxìng de xiàng guòjié shìde yíbèng-yítiào, pòbùjídài de pàn zhe chuān xīnyī. | Having listened to the New Year's Eve legend, the children skipped with joy as if celebrating a festival, eager to put on new clothes. | Tras escuchar la leyenda de fin de año, los niños saltaban de alegría como si ya fuera una fiesta, ansiosos por estrenar ropas nuevas.
  #2 | 随着数字技术的普及，现代社会的资讯传播快得像闪电似的，瞬间便能传遍大江南北。 | Suízhe shùzì jìshù de pǔjí, xiàndài shèhuì de zīxùn chuánbō kuài de xiàng shǎndiàn shìde, shùnjiān biàn néng chuán biàn dàjiāng nánběi. | With the spread of digital technology, information dissemination in modern society is as fast as lightning, sweeping across the entire nation in an instant. | Con la difusión tecnológica digital, la información fluye hoy veloz como el rayo, difundiéndose al instante por todos los rincones del país.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  像……似的 | like...; as if...
  仿佛……似的 | as though...; seemingly like...
  飞似的 | flying fast; like flying
  机器似的 | like a machine; mechanically
  傻子似的 | like a fool
  狂风似的 | like a tempest; whirlwind-like

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  光阴似箭 | guāng yīn sì jiàn | time flies like an arrow
  繁花似锦 | fán huā sì jǐn | flowers bloom like brocade; splendid prospects
  似懂非懂 | sì dǒng fēi dǒng | seem to understand yet not understand; half-comprehending
  似曾相识 | sì céng xiāng shí | seem familiar; feel like déjà vu

character_decomposition[2]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  似 | shì | like; resemble; as if | parecer; similar; semejante | 亻 | person / human | 亻 (person) | 以 (yǐ, by means of / phonetic) | 6 | 左右结构 | Phono-semantic compound where person radical 亻 combines with 以 (according to / resembling), indicating behavioral or visual resemblance. | A person (亻) standing alongside another (以), appearing strikingly similar in posture. | Una persona (亻) junto a otra (以) que muestra un asombroso parecido en su porte y figura. | 51 | OVIO | ""
  的 | de | possessive / structural particle | partícula estructural de posesión o modificación | 白 | white | 白 (white / bright) | 勺 (sháo, ladle / phonetic) | 8 | 左右结构 | Originally a bright bullseye target (dí); evolved into the universal grammatical marker of attribution and resemblance. | A bright white target (白) scooped up with a ladle (勺), serving as an anchor in speech. | Un blanco nítido y luminoso (白) señalado con un cucharón (勺) que sirve de ancla gramatical. | 55 | HAPI | ""

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Resembling a person (似) with a targeted description (的) creates vivid comparison particles like 'shì de'.
  composite_memory_hook_es: Asemejarse a alguien (似) mediante una descripción precisa (的) crea la partícula de semejanza 'shì de'.
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: In classical Chinese, 似 meant 'resemble' (sì). In early vernacular Mandarin (白话), 似 combined with nominalizer 的 to form 似的, traditionally read 'shì de' in northern dialects when expressing vivid sensory simulation (像……似的).
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Falling 4th tone 'shì' (51) followed by neutral tone 'de' (light, short pitch 2 or 1). Note that '似' is read 'sì' in formal disyllables (相似 xiāngsì), but colloquially read 'shì' in '似的'.

traps_and_cognates:
  look_alikes[5]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,distinction_note}:
    以 | yǐ | by means of; with | Lacks the single person radical 亻 on the left
    拟 | nǐ | draft; imitate; plan | Has hand radical 扌 on the left instead of person radical 亻
    钓 | diào | fish with a hook | Has metal radical 钅 next to 勺 instead of 白
    约 | yuē | agree; appointment | Has silk radical 纟 next to 勺
    目的 | mùdì | target; goal | The character 的 is polyphonic, read as 'dì' in 目的
  etymological_cognates[5]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
    象 | xiàng | resemble; elephant
    般 | bān | sort; manner; like
    仿 | fǎng | resemble; imitate
    若 | ruò | like; seem; if
    如 | rú | as if; like; such as

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 似的 functions as an auxiliary particle placed at the end of comparative phrases to express vivid sensory simulation ('like...').
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 似的 vs. 一般 | yībān | 似的 is an informal vernacular suffix forming comparative frames (像……似的), whereas 一般 is a more formal, literary comparative suffix (暴风雨一般) without requiring 像.
    2 | 似的 vs. 好像 | hǎoxiàng | 好像 is an adverb/conjunction appearing before the predicate to express subjective conjecture ('it seems that...'), while 似的 is a sentence-final particle reinforcing the simile.
    3 | 似的 vs. 一样 | yíyàng | 一样 indicates exact equivalence or identical identity/degree (跟……一样), whereas 似的 emphasizes figurative, poetic, or vivid subjective resemblance (像……似的).

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 除夕的雪夜里，满屋红烛摇曳，火光把老人的白发照得像银丝似的闪闪发亮。孩子们围坐在火炉旁，听着古老的年兽传说，心中涌起一阵阵波涛似的惊叹与敬佩，沉浸在温暖的年味里。 | Chúxī de xuěyè lǐ, mǎnwū hóngzhú yáoyè, huǒguāng bǎ lǎorén de báifà zhào de xiàng yínsī shìde shǎnshǎn fāliàng. Háizimen wéizuò zài huǒlú páng, tīng zhe gǔlǎo de Niánshòu chuánshuō, xīnzhōng yǒngqǐ yízhènzhèn bōtāo shìde jīngtàn yǔ jìngpèi, chénjìn zài wēnnuǎn de niánwèi lǐ. | On a snowy New Year's Eve, red candles flickered across the room, illuminating the elder's white hair until it gleamed like silver strands. Gathering around the hearth and listening to the ancient beast Nian legend, children felt surges of wave-like wonder and reverence, immersed in festive warmth. | En la nochevieja nevada, las velas rojas titilaban iluminando los cabellos blancos del anciano, brillantes como hilos de plata. Junto al fuego, al oír la leyenda de la fiera Nian, brotó en los niños un asombro como de olas marinas, arropados por la calidez del hogar.
  #2 | 在激烈的全球科技竞争中，关键核心技术犹如国家现代工业体系的心脏似的，任何一处短板都可能引发链条震荡。唯有强化自主创新，摆脱对外部供应链机器似的依赖，方能行稳致远。 | Zài jīliè de quánqiú kējì jìngzhēng zhōng, guānjiàn héxīn jìshù yóurú guójiā xiàndài gōngyè tǐxì de xīnzàng shìde, rènhé yí chù duǎnbǎn dōu kěnéng yǐnfā liàntiáo zhèndàng. Wéiyǒu qiánghuà zìzhǔ chuàngxīn, bǎituō duì wàibù gōngyìngliàn jīqì shìde yīlài, fāng néng xíngwěn-zhìyuǎn. | In fierce global tech rivalry, key core technologies function like the heart of a nation's modern industrial system; any vulnerability can disrupt entire chains. Only by strengthening independent innovation and shedding mechanical dependence on external supply chains can steady and sustained progress be secured. | En la reñida competencia tecnológica global, las tecnologías clave operan como el corazón del sistema industrial contemporáneo. Solo afianzando la innovación autónoma y superando la dependencia mecánica de cadenas foráneas podrá el país avanzar con firmeza hacia el futuro.